Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 5.1 092/219] net: hns3: fix for dereferencing before null checking
Date:   Mon, 15 Jul 2019 10:01:33 -0400
Message-Id: <20190715140341.6443-92-sashal@kernel.org>
